[9.286425, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[31mE       AssertionError: assert 'INVOICE INV-...   4,127.04\\n' == 'INVOICE INV-...   4,127.06\\n'\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[31mE         \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[31mE         Skipping 442 identical leading characters in diff, use -v to show\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[31mE         -      134.87     884.12\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[31mE         ?           ^          ^\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[31mE         +      134.86     884.11\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[31mE         ?           ^          ^\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[31mE         - API overage, 1,001 calls                            250.25      45.05     295.30...\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[31mE         \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[31mE         ...Full output truncated (14 lines hidden), use '-vv' to show\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[31mtests/test_billing.py\u001b[0m:83: AssertionError\r\n\u001b[31m\u001b[1m__________________________________________________________ test_invoice_matches_golden[INV-2024-0107] __________________________________________________________\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nnumber = 'INV-2024-0107'\r\n\r\n"]
